# IEEE 118 student cells, cell B (2026-10-13): the IEEE 118-adapted adapter of cell A
# (research_full_pipeline_20261013_ieee118_student/out/r1/training/lora) evaluated
# zero-shot on the IEEE 14 development roots of the 2026-10-07 classifier cell (the
# 160 roots its own round-2 student scored 159/160 on), under the classifier-gated
# profile with the joint gate the adapter was trained against.  Stage 0 links the
# classifier cell's expert aggregate (PREVIOUS_PIPE; the pool is only mixed into the
# round-1 collection here, nothing trains) and the adapter as bc0; the suite is
# copied from that cell before submission (launch_student_cells_20261013.sh), so the
# development roots are the classifier cell's 160.  The chain d0 -> r1c -> zs
# collects one IEEE 14 round with the adapted student (the zero-shot stage reuses
# the collection's ledger) and then scores the adapter and the expert on the
# development roots; it is queued behind cell A's training job (DEPEND and
# ALLOW_PARALLEL_CHAIN in submit_pipeline.sh).  IEEE 14 keeps the pipeline's
# default progress basis (chi_square_statistic) and corpora.
# Deploy and submit from Windows (SSH master up), after cell A:
#   bash research/hpc/full_pipeline_20260907/launch_student_cells_20261013.sh
# which runs, for this cell, PIPE=/scratch/yx3882/research_full_pipeline_20261013_ieee14_reverse
# SOURCE_CELL=/scratch/yx3882/research_full_pipeline_20261011_ieee118 BASE=bf22a8d
# OVERRIDES=ieee14_reverse_20261013.env deploy_cell_from_windows.sh <commit40> and then
# DEPEND=<cell A r1t job> ALLOW_PARALLEL_CHAIN=1 CHAIN="d0 r1c zs" bash submit_pipeline.sh.
EXPERT_VARIANT=baseline
EVIDENCE_PROFILE=classifier_gated_diagnostics
HIF_SIGNATURE_MODE=discovered
# An expert label the audit cannot verify ends its episode and is recorded instead of
# aborting the collection (the IEEE 118 cells' research tolerance).
UNVERIFIED_EXPERT_LABEL_POLICY=stop
# The classifier cell's expert aggregate stands in as the round-1 pool.
PREVIOUS_PIPE=/scratch/yx3882/research_full_pipeline_20261007_classifier
# The joint IEEE 14 + 118 gate (IEEE 14 threshold 0.096; 99.2% recall, 0.9% unneeded
# on the IEEE 14 test split), the gate the adapted student collected and trained under.
TRIAGE_CLASSIFIER=$SRC/psse_env/oracle/models/triage_gnn_joint_20261011
# Student: the round-1 candidate of cell A, linked as this run's bc0 by stage 0, which
# therefore waits for cell A's training job.
FROZEN_STUDENT_ADAPTER=/scratch/yx3882/research_full_pipeline_20261013_ieee118_student/out/r1/training/lora
FROZEN_STUDENT_EVIDENCE_PROFILE=classifier_gated_diagnostics
ZEROSHOT_EVAL_NAME=zeroshot
